#
# Functions of other components the USB HID driver calls: the USB core
# (`usb_v1`) to claim its interface, and the host controller (`usb_hcd_v1`) for
# interrupt-IN reports. Both `uses` declarations need the device tree link of
# the HID component, which is an open decision (see doc/agentic/usb-design.md).
